### Fetch active routes (used by the food collection recording screen)
GET {{baseApiPath}}/routes/active

### Fetch all routes (maintenance screen)
GET {{baseApiPath}}/routes

### Create a route
POST {{baseApiPath}}/routes
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "number": 4.0,
  "name": "Route 4",
  "note": "Notiz zur Route",
  "enabled": true,
  "stops": [
    {
      "time": "14:00",
      "shopId": 1,
      "description": "Erster Stopp"
    },
    {
      "time": "14:30",
      "shopId": null,
      "description": "Pause"
    }
  ]
}

### Update a route
PUT {{baseApiPath}}/routes/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": 1,
  "number": 1.0,
  "name": "Route 1",
  "note": "Notiz 1",
  "enabled": true,
  "stops": [
    {
      "time": "14:00",
      "shopId": 1,
      "description": null
    }
  ]
}

### Fetch shops for a specific route
GET {{baseApiPath}}/routes/1/shops

### Fetch the driver guidance for a route (stops in order, shop details, today's progress)
GET {{baseApiPath}}/routes/1/guidance

### Tick a stop off for today (send false to undo it)
PUT {{baseApiPath}}/routes/1/guidance/stops/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "completed": true
}
